# Blink project rules

- Root `AGENTS.md` is authoritative. Follow it for commands, API contracts, and security rules.
- Use `make help` to discover shortcuts; prefer `make check` and `make build` over ad-hoc commands.
- Never commit secrets, `.env`, `*.db`, `web/dist/`, `web/node_modules/`, or `blink-monitor/target/`.
- Keep `docs/` and `AGENTS.md` in sync when architecture or commands change.
- Project skills live in `.cursor/skills/` and are mirrored in `.agents/skills/`.
